{"id":"6beac1a1c0b26ad2","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-provably-equivalent.md","title":"Provably Equivalent","display":"df-provably-equivalent — Provably Equivalent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-provably-equivalent","aliases":["92-df-provably-equivalent"],"display":"df-provably-equivalent — Provably Equivalent","depends_on":["[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-g-system]]"],"source":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义","source_status":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-provably-equivalent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-provably-equivalent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provably-equivalent — Provably Equivalent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_G\">\\(\\equiv_G\\)</span> (definition-target provable-equivalence relation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provably\\text{-}equivalent} \\vdash\n\\varphi\\equiv_G\\psi\\Longleftrightarrow G\\vdash(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provably\\text{-}equivalent} \\vdash\n\\varphi\\equiv_G\\psi\\Longleftrightarrow G\\vdash(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\equiv_G \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\equiv_G \\psi\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可证等价</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G \\vdash \\varphi \\leftrightarrow \\psi\">\\(G \\vdash \\varphi \\leftrightarrow \\psi\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>证明两者等价</li>\n<li>可证等价是语法概念（不同于逻辑等价）</li>\n<li>即使<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>对标准算术模型可靠，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\equiv_G\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\equiv_G\\psi\\)</span>通常也只保证二者在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span>的所有赋值下同真同假；因为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>含非逻辑算术公理，它不自动蕴含在所有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-语言结构中的逻辑等价</li>\n<li>可证等价公式可在推导中互相替换</li>\n<li>对由对角引理针对可证性公式构造的Gödel句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>，有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\equiv_G\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\">\\(\\gamma\\equiv_G\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\)</span>；这是该特定构造的定理，不是任意句子的性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formulas, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vdash$ (provability relation, see [[92-df-provable]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provably\\text{-}equivalent} \\vdash\n\\varphi\\equiv_G\\psi\\Longleftrightarrow G\\vdash(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi \\equiv_G \\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G \\vdash \\varphi \\leftrightarrow \\psi","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\equiv_G\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\equiv_G\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":1683,"backlinks":[{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-provably-equivalent]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-provably-equivalent]]"}],"outgoing":["51c43e0240787ebb","5a1bd470754681a7","e0eabee5d77258a7"]}